#~ "This unit is able to stun its enemies, disrupting their zones of control."
#~ msgstr " 이 유닛은 적들을 마비시켜 통제 권역에 지장을 줄 수 있습니다."

#~ msgid "Kraken"
#~ msgstr "크라켄"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Krakens are gigantic creatures of the seas. They can grab their opponents "
